{"id":"torrey:hyke-or-upper-garment","source":"torrey","name":"Hyke Or Upper Garment","slug":"hyke-or-upper-garment","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Law respecting fringes of — Nu 15:38; De 22:12.","refs":[["Num",15,38,15,38],["Deut",22,12,22,12]]},{"text":"Used by the poor as a covering by night — Ex 22:26,27; De 24:13.","refs":[["Exod",22,26,22,26],["Exod",22,27,22,27],["Deut",24,13,24,13]]},{"text":"Burdens often bound up in — Ex 12:34.","refs":[["Exod",12,34,12,34]]},{"text":"The skirts of, used to hold things in — 2Ki 4:39; Ne 5:13; Hag 2:12; Lu 6:38.","refs":[["2Kgs",4,39,4,39],["Neh",5,13,5,13],["Hag",2,12,2,12],["Luke",6,38,6,38]]},{"text":"Probably used by women as a vail — Ru 3:15.","refs":[["Ruth",3,15,3,15]]},{"text":"For running. — 1Ki 18:46.","refs":[["1Kgs",18,46,18,46]]},{"text":"For labour. — Lu 17:8.","refs":[["Luke",17,8,17,8]]},{"text":"Often laid aside — Mt 24:18; Mr 10:50.","refs":[["Matt",24,18,24,18],["Mark",10,50,10,50]]},{"text":"The Jews said to be naked without — 2Sa 6:20; Mr 14:51,52; Joh 21:7.","refs":[["2Sam",6,20,6,20],["Mark",14,51,14,51],["Mark",14,52,14,52],["John",21,7,21,7]]},{"text":"Rent in token of anger. — Mt 26:65.","refs":[["Matt",26,65,26,65]]},{"text":"Rent in token of grief. — Joe 2:13.","refs":[["Joel",2,13,2,13]]},{"text":"Of Samuel rent by Saul. — 1Sa 15:27.","refs":[["1Sam",15,27,15,27]]},{"text":"Of Saul which David cut. — 1Sa 24:4,5.","refs":[["1Sam",24,4,24,4],["1Sam",24,5,24,5]]},{"text":"Of Jeroboam rent by Ahijah. — 1Ki 11:30.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,30,11,30]]},{"text":"Laid aside by Christ. — Joh 13:4.","refs":[["John",13,4,13,4]]},{"text":"Spread before Christ by the Jews. — Mt 21:8.","refs":[["Matt",21,8,21,8]]},{"text":"The Jews condemned for making broad the borders of — Mt 23:5.","refs":[["Matt",23,5,23,5]]}],"refCount":28}
